{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And you shall put water there.</b> It appears that there is no obligation to do this thing through Moses; rather, the same applies to any non-priest — he may put water into the laver. Just as at the beginning of the verse it says ״וְעָשִׂיתָ כִּיּוֹר״ etc., the intention is not that he himself must make it."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:34:34.758832477Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}